# config.js carries only client-safe values (TMDB v3 key, which is a client-side
# key by design, and the Supabase anon/public key). Real secrets — the Supabase
# service_role key and DB password — are never placed here. It is committed so
# the deployed Vercel site is configured. To keep the TMDB key private instead,
# blank `apiKey` here and set a TMDB_API_KEY env var on Vercel (api/tmdb.js uses it).

